          "published_at": "2026-11-22T21:35:30.075Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/mitsuhiko/status/2124617793324696046",
          "topic": "AI-assisted family party-game development",
          "text": "Had a weekend alone with the boys and we used the airplay/chrome cast code I prepared to build and play some party games. Sometimes slop can be so damn enjoyable. It's just so much fun to play around with it and make it your own.",
          "attachments": [
            {
              "type": "link_card",
              "url": "https://tvpipe.party/",
              "title": "tvpipe: video from your computer on the TV",
              "publisher": "tvpipe.party",
              "thumbnail_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2124617795073626112/q9V1MIte?format=webp&name=medium"
            }
          ],
          "quote_tweet": null,
          "author_replies": [
