              "published_at": "2026-11-22T21:36:37.317Z",
              "author": {
                "name": "Armin Ronacher ⇌",
                "handle": "mitsuhiko"
              },
              "text": "Middle son's favorite is Jinx, which is a take on Just One. tvpipe.party/games/jinx/ (thanks @daniel_levine for getting us on that one :D)",
