          "published_at": "2026-11-22T13:05:53.080Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/thorstenball/status/2124489544112415126",
          "topic": "AI-assisted tvOS game development",
          "text": "Dude, this is a lot of fun.\n\nPassing the Apple TV remote back and forth is a lot of fun for a turn-based game.\n\nSurprisingly easy to deploy to: select TV as target in Xcode, hit Cmd-R.",
